{
  "summary": "This experiment tested avgpool aggregation and concat fusion with scvi_n200 RNA and ViT-L image encoders, replacing transformer aggregation and weighted fusion from config_039. Validation accuracy (0.7150) and F1 (0.6872) are slightly lower than config_039's 0.7250 accuracy and 0.6847 F1, suggesting avgpool and concat may be less effective than transformer and weighted methods. The relative impact of aggregation and fusion choices remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

